{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9304a3c7068ff6e770f1c05baa99f04ceb1a2cd829bb81c8c779b345bcba23f1", "ja": "そろそろ握手会が始まるな……。\nジュリア、準備はいいか？", "zh": "握手会差不多要开始了啊……\n茱莉亚，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "ef73d3827160bebee259a4ff6ef4eafa8a81c532da7cdb900e9f5789b5e94457", "ja": "ああ、いつでもバッチリだ。\n最近この、握手会ってのにもちょっと慣れてきたんだ。", "zh": "好了，随时开始都没问题。\n我最近也开始习惯这种握手会活动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "3867cbd5f8ce576a5443d52fcc1b9a76b56b0a2b549b7b27750db69636558c98", "ja": "ああ。お客さんから、ライブや歌の感想を直接聞けるし\n……今日も朝から、楽しみにしてきたんだ♪", "zh": "对啊，毕竟也可以直接听见客人对演唱会或歌曲的感想。\n……今天我也从早上就开始期待了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "6fce8d0094cd4af74cc76c0a07c9988cd2811ac927d47a28772357d78dd68b0f", "ja": "だから短い時間でも満足してもらえるように、\nあたしなりに頑張るよ。", "zh": "所以我也要尽自己所能，努力让客人\n在短暂的时间内也能感到满足喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
